                <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Wiring Instructions:&lt;/b&gt; Move the &lt;b style='color:#16A34A'&gt;Green wire&lt;/b&gt; from IDC40P Terminal 8 to &lt;b&gt;Terminal 32&lt;/b&gt; (PWM0). Move the &lt;b style='color:#2563EB'&gt;Blue wire&lt;/b&gt; from Terminal 10 to &lt;b&gt;Terminal 33&lt;/b&gt; (PWM2). &lt;b&gt;Black wire&lt;/b&gt; stays on Terminal 14 (GND). On the Storm32 side, all three wires stay on the same RC header pins (outer row: GND, RC-0, RC-2)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#F59E0B;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=1.5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
